WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.907
Watch and read: For your characters practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:04.907 --> 00:00:09.614
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:09.614 --> 00:00:09.928
character?

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:14.901
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:21.501
Watch and read: Ama asks: Read: “First Ama found a lost pencil. Next Ama asked for

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:25.789
help. Finally Ama returned the pencil to the teacher.” What happened finally?

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:31.239
The answer is: returned the pencil to the teacher. Look for the last event when

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:32.163
retelling in order.
